  "body": "I joined a remote room at matrix.org from my homeserver as admin. I don't have permission to list the remote room in the room directory of my homeserver. For this I would have to be a moderator or admin in the remote room. There is no possibility to list a remote room in the room directory as admin of a homeserver. A simple way is missing. An admin should stay an admin.\r\n\r\nv0.33.3\r\n",
